{"base_rate":0.12195121951219512,"brier":0.06455235772357723,"bss":0.3971527037037037,"bss_hi":0.5110007820367183,"bss_lo":0.2781419013717347,"chart":{"base":[220.1,127.2],"fp":[200.5,258.4],"lead":"62,258.1 272,233.4 482,187.9 692,124.8","note":{"base":"skill 0.40 — higher than 69% of cities","fp":"low end +2pp, high end +16pp","lead":"day-1 error 1.0 °C — better than 67% of cities","rel":"promised 1% → rained 2%; promised 50% → rained 50%"},"rel":"70,455.4 379.7,251.7"},"country":"IR","deep":false,"depth":["Rain-probability calibration","Calibration curve","Seasonal split"],"ece":0.022585365853658543,"ess":330.1916131239788,"html":{"answer":"\n<h2 id=\"answer\">The short answer for Mashhad</h2>\n<div class=\"verdict\">\n<p class=\"lead\"><b>The Mashhad rain forecast is genuinely useful, and honest except at one point on the scale.</b></p>\n<p>When it says rain is <i>near certain</i> (74%), believe about\n<b>67%</b>. When it says rain is <i>very unlikely</i>\n(0%), there is still roughly a <b>1%</b> chance.</p>\n<p class=\"muted\">Based on 615 days, 2024-04-26 to\n2026-02-27. \"Rain\" means at least 0.2 mm measured at\nthe station, 3.8 km from the forecast grid point.\nSkill score 0.40, ranked 42 of\n134 &mdash; but see the rank <i>range</i>\n(14&ndash;82) before reading anything into\nthat position.</p>\n</div>\n\n<h3>What the percentages actually mean here</h3>\n<div class=\"tablewrap\">\n<table><thead><tr><th class=\"num\">It said</th><th class=\"num\">It rained</th>\n<th class=\"num\">Days</th><th>Verdict</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td class='num'>0%</td><td class='num'><b>1%</b></td><td class='num'>430</td><td><span class=\"tag bad\">underpromised</span></td></tr><tr><td class='num'>8%</td><td class='num'><b>10%</b></td><td class='num'>58</td><td><span class=\"tag good\">honest</span></td></tr><tr><td class='num'>26%</td><td class='num'><b>32%</b></td><td class='num'>63</td><td><span class=\"tag good\">honest</span></td></tr><tr><td class='num'>74%</td><td class='num'><b>67%</b></td><td class='num'>64</td><td><span class=\"tag good\">honest</span></td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<p class=\"muted\">1 of 4 groups are further from honest than chance\nalone can explain. The rest are indistinguishable from a perfect forecast.</p>\n","card":"\n<div class=\"gcard\">\n  <p class=\"gcard-head\"><b>Mashhad</b> <span class=\"muted\">IR</span></p>\n  <p class=\"gcard-tier\"><span class=\"tag good\">Genuinely useful</span>\n    <span class=\"muted\">honest except at one point</span></p>\n  <dl class=\"gcard-stats\">\n    <div><dt>Skill score</dt><dd>0.40</dd></div>\n    <div><dt>Rank</dt><dd>14&ndash;82\n      <span class=\"muted\">of 134</span></dd></div>\n    <div><dt>Record</dt><dd>615 <span class=\"muted\">days</span></dd></div>\n  </dl>\n  <p class=\"gcard-more\"><a href=\"#answer\">The full verdict for\n    Mashhad &darr;</a></p>\n</div>","curve":"\n<h2 id=\"curve\">The calibration curve</h2>\n<p>Each dot is a group of days sharing a similar forecast. Horizontal position\nis what was promised; vertical is what happened. <b>On the dashed diagonal =\nhonest.</b> Hover any dot for its sample size.</p>\n<figure><svg viewBox=\"0 0 430 430\" width=\"100%\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Calibration curve for Mashhad\"><rect class=\"chart-plot\" x=\"58\" y=\"18\" width=\"354\" height=\"364\"/><line class=\"chart-grid\" x1=\"58\" y1=\"382\" x2=\"58\" y2=\"18\"/><line class=\"chart-grid\" x1=\"58\" y1=\"382\" x2=\"412\" y2=\"382\"/><text class=\"chart-axis\" x=\"58\" y=\"399\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\">0%</text><text class=\"chart-axis\" x=\"49\" y=\"386\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"end\">0%</text><line class=\"chart-grid\" x1=\"146.5\" y1=\"382\" x2=\"146.5\" y2=\"18\"/><line class=\"chart-grid\" x1=\"58\" y1=\"291.0\" x2=\"412\" y2=\"291.0\"/><text class=\"chart-axis\" x=\"146.5\" y=\"399\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\">25%</text><text class=\"chart-axis\" x=\"49\" y=\"295.0\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"end\">25%</text><line class=\"chart-grid\" x1=\"235.0\" y1=\"382\" x2=\"235.0\" y2=\"18\"/><line class=\"chart-grid\" x1=\"58\" y1=\"200.0\" x2=\"412\" y2=\"200.0\"/><text class=\"chart-axis\" x=\"235.0\" y=\"399\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\">50%</text><text class=\"chart-axis\" x=\"49\" y=\"204.0\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"end\">50%</text><line class=\"chart-grid\" x1=\"323.5\" y1=\"382\" x2=\"323.5\" y2=\"18\"/><line class=\"chart-grid\" x1=\"58\" y1=\"109.0\" x2=\"412\" y2=\"109.0\"/><text class=\"chart-axis\" x=\"323.5\" y=\"399\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\">75%</text><text class=\"chart-axis\" x=\"49\" y=\"113.0\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"end\">75%</text><line class=\"chart-grid\" x1=\"412\" y1=\"382\" x2=\"412\" y2=\"18\"/><line class=\"chart-grid\" x1=\"58\" y1=\"18\" x2=\"412\" y2=\"18\"/><text class=\"chart-axis\" x=\"412\" y=\"399\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\">100%</text><text class=\"chart-axis\" x=\"49\" y=\"22\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"end\">100%</text><polygon class=\"chart-band\" points=\"59.17725581395349,378.6139534883721 87.05241379310345,325.51724137931035 150.60190476190473,249.11111111111111 321.06625,74.875 321.06625,148.8125 150.60190476190473,324.22222222222223 87.05241379310345,375.7241379310345 59.17725581395349,382.0\" opacity=\"0.16\"/><line class=\"chart-ideal\" x1=\"58\" y1=\"382\" x2=\"412\" y2=\"18\" stroke-dasharray=\"5,4\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"/><line class=\"chart-base\" x1=\"58\" y1=\"337.609756097561\" x2=\"412\" y2=\"337.609756097561\" stroke-dasharray=\"2,3\"/><polyline class=\"chart-line\" points=\"59.17725581395349,376.92093023255813 87.05241379310345,344.3448275862069 150.60190476190473,266.44444444444446 321.06625,137.4375\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2.4\"/><g class=\"pt\" data-tip=\"Forecast said 0%&amp;#10;It rained 1% of the time&amp;#10;Based on 430 days&amp;#10;outside the perfect-forecast range - real miscalibration\"><circle class=\"chart-dot sig\" cx=\"59.17725581395349\" cy=\"376.92093023255813\" r=\"6.5\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></g><g class=\"pt\" data-tip=\"Forecast said 8%&amp;#10;It rained 10% of the time&amp;#10;Based on 58 days&amp;#10;within the range a perfect forecast would give\"><circle class=\"chart-dot\" cx=\"87.05241379310345\" cy=\"344.3448275862069\" r=\"6.5\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></g><g class=\"pt\" data-tip=\"Forecast said 26%&amp;#10;It rained 32% of the time&amp;#10;Based on 63 days&amp;#10;within the range a perfect forecast would give\"><circle class=\"chart-dot\" cx=\"150.60190476190473\" cy=\"266.44444444444446\" r=\"6.5\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></g><g class=\"pt\" data-tip=\"Forecast said 74%&amp;#10;It rained 67% of the time&amp;#10;Based on 64 days&amp;#10;within the range a perfect forecast would give\"><circle class=\"chart-dot\" cx=\"321.06625\" cy=\"137.4375\" r=\"6.5\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></g><text class=\"chart-label\" x=\"235.0\" y=\"422\" font-size=\"12.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\">What the forecast promised</text><text class=\"chart-label\" x=\"15\" y=\"200.0\" font-size=\"12.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\" transform=\"rotate(-90 15 200.0)\">How often it actually rained</text></svg>\n<figcaption>Green band = where a <b>flawless</b> forecast would still land, given\nhow few days we have. Red dots fall outside it, so those are real errors rather\nthan noise. The faint horizontal line is climatology\n(12%).</figcaption></figure>\n","season":"\n<h2 id=\"season\">Does the season matter?</h2>\n<p>In Mashhad the forecast is most skilful in\n<b>spring</b> (0.50) and least in\n<b>summer</b> (0.17).</p>\n<div class=\"tablewrap\">\n<table><thead><tr><th>Season</th><th class=\"num\">Days</th>\n<th class=\"num\">Rain days</th><th class=\"num\">Skill score</th>\n<th class=\"num\">Avg error</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>summer</td><td class='num'>160</td><td class='num'>5%</td><td class='num'>0.167</td><td class='num'>1.9%</td></tr><tr><td>winter</td><td class='num'>155</td><td class='num'>19%</td><td class='num'>0.273</td><td class='num'>3.4%</td></tr><tr><td>autumn</td><td class='num'>172</td><td class='num'>5%</td><td class='num'>0.402</td><td class='num'>1.8%</td></tr><tr><td>spring</td><td class='num'>128</td><td class='num'>23%</td><td class='num'>0.500</td><td class='num'>3.9%</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<p class=\"muted\">Four-way splits of a two-year record are thin, so read the\nordering as indicative. Coarser binning is used here than for the annual curve\nfor the same reason.</p>\n"},"lat":36.29807,"lon":59.60567,"n":615,"n_cities":134,"name":"Mashhad","offset_days":0,"pop_map":[{"hi":0.046000000000001366,"lo":0.0,"mean":0.003325581395348837,"n":430,"obs":0.013953488372093023,"sig":true},{"hi":0.18,"lo":0.046000000000001366,"mean":0.0820689655172414,"n":58,"obs":0.10344827586206896,"sig":false},{"hi":0.43,"lo":0.18,"mean":0.26158730158730154,"n":63,"obs":0.31746031746031744,"sig":false},{"hi":1.0,"lo":0.43,"mean":0.743125,"n":64,"obs":0.671875,"sig":false}],"prcp_km":3.8,"provisional":false,"rank":42,"rank_hi":82.0,"rank_lo":14.0,"reliability":0.0009701673098932089,"resolution":0.04357382190438485,"skill_pct":null,"slug":"mashhad","station":"","timezone":"Asia/Tehran"}